{%- comment -%}
  al_folio_core's bib.liquid includes this hook for every entry, right after it
  builds the venue text (`entrytype`: venue, location and `additional_info`),
  with `entry` in scope (docs/CUSTOMIZE.md).

  - The venue line shows no date: the year headings already give the year.
    Clearing the month and year stops bib.liquid from appending them.
  - `additional_info` goes through markdownify, which leaves a trailing
    newline; strip it.
  - `additional_info` starts with its own separator (", ERA Track",
    ". Also presented at ..."). When an entry has no venue, drop that leading
    separator so the line does not start with punctuation.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign entrytype = entrytype | strip -%}
{%- assign pv_text = entrytype | strip_html | strip -%}
{%- assign pv_first = pv_text | slice: 0 -%}
{%- if pv_first == ',' or pv_first == '.' -%}
  {%- assign entrytype = entrytype | remove_first: pv_first | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign entrymonth = '' -%}
{%- assign entryyear = '' -%}
